# Legacy studio URL (was served under /puck-proof/) → now the site root.
# Forced (!) so they win over Netlify's default trailing-slash / asset handling.
# Hash deep-links (#account, #shop, #join/<token>, #order-confirmed) are carried across the 301 by the browser.
/puck-proof          /             301!
/puck-proof/         /             301!
/puck-proof/*        /:splat       301!
# SPA fallback — must stay last, unforced so real assets are served first
/*                   /index.html   200
